        "original_id": "75cdc376-10a0-51ae-bc61-4161fc0a74ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chantal Claret, Max Green, Pedro Yanowitz\n- Bands/Projects: Morningwood, Escape the Fate, The Natural Born Killers\n- Products: Diamonds & Studs\n\nFacts:\n- Chantal Claret Euringer was born on February 21, 1982, and Chantal Claret is an American singer-songwriter.\n- Maxwell Scott Green was born on December 15, 1984, and Max Green is an American musician.\n- Morningwood was founded in 2001 and primarily consisted of Pedro Yanowitz and Chantal Claret.\n- Max Green was one of the founders of Escape the Fate and served as its bassist and backing vocalist.\n- Max Green was also a former rhythm guitarist and vocalist for The Natural Born Killers.\n- Diamonds & Studs is the second album by Morningwood.",
